      </textobject>
      <textobject id="40" name="Doc-Telemetry-Body" type="text">
        <data>&lt;div id="customText40" class="customShape customText context-menu" data-path="40" style="display:inline;position:absolute;left:1195px;top:325px;cursor:move;z-index:15;"&gt;&lt;p align="left" style="vertical-align:top;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;font-family:monospace;"&gt;• EveBox SIEM Web UI : http://192.168.1.35:5636 (Real-time Event Management)&lt;br/&gt;• Suricata 8.0.7 NIDS: AF_PACKET promiscuous capture on pnet1 &amp;amp; pnet0&lt;br/&gt;• EVE Log Source     : /var/log/suricata/eve.json&lt;br/&gt;• Node Consoles      : Kali (32772) | Cisco SW (32770) | Router (32771)&lt;br/&gt;• OPNsense Web / VNC : https://192.168.1.1 (LAN) / VNC Port 5900&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</data>
      </textobject>
