      <textobject id="42" name="Doc-Attacks-Header" type="text">
        <data>&lt;div id="customText42" class="customShape customText context-menu" data-path="42" style="display:inline;position:absolute;left:1195px;top:492px;cursor:move;z-index:15;"&gt;&lt;p align="left" style="vertical-align:top;color:#ffffff;background-color:#dc3545;font-size:12px;font-weight: bold;padding:2px 8px;"&gt;ADVERSARY ATTACK PROCEDURES (EXECUTE FROM KALI)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</data>
      </textobject>
      <textobject id="43" name="Doc-Attacks-Body" type="text">
        <data>&lt;div id="customText43" class="customShape customText context-menu" data-path="43" style="display:inline;position:absolute;left:1195px;top:520px;cursor:move;z-index:15;"&gt;&lt;p align="left" style="vertical-align:top;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;font-family:monospace;"&gt;1. Stealth SYN Scan  : sudo nmap -sS -Pn -p 21,22,23,80,443,3389 172.31.255.1&lt;br/&gt;2. Web SQL Injection : curl -s &quot;http://172.31.255.1/?id=1 UNION SELECT ...&quot;&lt;br/&gt;3. Shellshock Exploit: curl -H &quot;User-Agent: () { :;}; echo RCE&quot; http://172.31.255.1/...&lt;br/&gt;4. Automated Script  : /home/kali/kali-redteam-attack.sh 172.31.255.1&lt;br/&gt;5. Triage in EveBox  : Query by src_ip: 172.31.255.100 and review alerts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</data>
